Tim Scott refused to hold votes on certain amendments he claimed had \\'technical drafting errors,\\' yet proceeded with other amendments having the same issues', 'Democratic amendments that failed included: Catherine Cortez Masto\\'s proposal for more law enforcement authority over crypto cases, and Tina Smith\\'s amendment to prohibit federal bailouts of crypto companies', 'Crypto markets reacted positively: Bitcoin rallied to 2,000, Coinbase shares surged 10%, and crypto stocks broadly gained on the regulatory clarity hopes', 'Stand With Crypto, a Coinbase-backed advocacy group, announced it would score lawmakers based on this vote and integrate these scores into future election endorsements', 'The Solana Policy Institute expects the House will likely pass identical language if it clears the Senate, sending it directly to the President\\'s desk']}. You MUST finish the article completely, ending with the Sources and Word Count block."}],"timestamp":1778823711340}}
